# Playwright e2e and accessibility
- Test critical user flows end-to-end; run on iPad viewports plus one desktop.
- Remember the base path `/learning-hub/` in `baseURL`/`goto`.
- Prefer role/label locators (`getByRole`, `getByLabel`) over CSS; this also checks semantics.
- Keyboard: logical tab order, visible focus, every action reachable without a mouse.
- Semantic HTML first, ARIA only where needed; live regions for async errors/status.
- Text and controls meet WCAG 2.1 AA contrast; touch targets are at least 44px.
- Automated WCAG scans with `@axe-core/playwright` only if it's added as a devDependency (ask first; don't add deps silently).
- Offline: verify core flows still work with `context.setOffline(true)` after the SW installs.
